Modifications in this overlay add bounded sprinkler coordination, normalized
and evidence-labelled sprinkler payloads, exact-duration commands, response-only
Home Assistant services, explicit zone metadata attributes, and related tests
and deployment guards. Modified files carry SPDX and modification notices where
their file format permits comments.
